// Names of the OpenTelemetry GenAI semantic conventions: the attribute keys, the
// metric names, the span types and the event names that a backend, a dashboard
// and a collector all agree on. Constants only, no code and no dependency, so any
// library can name what it records without pulling a runtime in.
//
// OpenTelemetry semantic conventions for generative AI:
// https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions-genai
